WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.980
Across the misty highlands
and rugged coastlines of Scotland

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.440
rise ancient guardians of history,
castles that have stood

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.720
for centuries, watching silently
as time unfolds.

4
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.620
From the windswept battlements
of Eilean Donan, perched at the

5
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.740
meeting point of three sea lochs,

6
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.040
to the towering might of Edinburgh Castle,
carved into the very rock

7
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.980
it rests upon, these fortresses
are more than stone and mortar.

8
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.400
They are stories frozen in time.

9
00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.660
Each castle whispers legends
of kings and clans,

10
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.400
betrayals and bravery.
Stirling Castle,

11
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.860
